    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic yet captivating life of a <strong>Railway Chai Wala</strong> at the Fakripur railway station, where the rhythm of trains is matched only by the hustle of hungry passengers. Ramu, a hardworking chaiwala running his shop at the Fakripur railway station. From brewing chai to frying samosas, serving guests, and selling cola, your daily tasks are as lively as the trains rushing past. But beneath the vibrant surface of sizzling samosas and steaming chai lies a web of secrets waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chai Brewing:</strong> Show your skills in brewing the perfect cup of chai and coffee, delighting passengers with authentic Indian flavors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/eb5824ab2f3b8846d15935238ee5b783.poster.avif?t=1741766270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/eb5824ab2f3b8846d15935238ee5b783.webm?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/eb5824ab2f3b8846d15935238ee5b783.mp4?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indian Snacks Galore:</strong> Serve crispy samosas, prepare mouthwatering vada pav, and offer chilled Kokila Kola to satisfy a variety of cravings for hungry travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/7e653f8862f1f1c23ea02699ba5d086e.poster.avif?t=1741766270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/7e653f8862f1f1c23ea02699ba5d086e.webm?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/7e653f8862f1f1c23ea02699ba5d086e.mp4?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage with Passengers:</strong> Meet a colorful cast of characters, each with their own quirks, stories, and sometimes with eerie behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/b0fbf87939bd859798f5e7d5f8922443.poster.avif?t=1741766270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/b0fbf87939bd859798f5e7d5f8922443.webm?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/b0fbf87939bd859798f5e7d5f8922443.mp4?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Railway Platform Realism:</strong> Experience the sights, sounds, and chaos of a bustling Indian railway station, complete with dynamic crowds and lifelike audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/620553fe7abaf2539a5d0cfbda2c7f9e.poster.avif?t=1741766270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/620553fe7abaf2539a5d0cfbda2c7f9e.webm?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/620553fe7abaf2539a5d0cfbda2c7f9e.mp4?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Mysteries Unfold:</strong> Encounter strange events and uncover the hidden, spine-chilling secrets lurking in the station\u2019s shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Indian Vibes:</strong> Immerse yourself in the cultural essence of India with vibrant visuals, detailed environments, and an atmospheric soundtrack that brings Fakripur to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s brewing chai or unraveling mysteries, <strong>Railway Chai Wala</strong> is a game that blends the warmth of Indian hospitality with the thrill of suspense. Can you thrive as Fakripur\u2019s favorite chaiwala while braving the station\u2019s enigmatic secrets? The answers await in this one-of-a-kind adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic yet captivating life of a <strong>Railway Chai Wala</strong> at the Fakripur railway station, where the rhythm of trains is matched only by the hustle of hungry passengers. Ramu, a hardworking chaiwala running his shop at the Fakripur railway station. From brewing chai to frying samosas, serving guests, and selling cola, your daily tasks are as lively as the trains rushing past. But beneath the vibrant surface of sizzling samosas and steaming chai lies a web of secrets waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chai Brewing:</strong> Show your skills in brewing the perfect cup of chai and coffee, delighting passengers with authentic Indian flavors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/eb5824ab2f3b8846d15935238ee5b783.poster.avif?t=1741766270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/eb5824ab2f3b8846d15935238ee5b783.webm?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/eb5824ab2f3b8846d15935238ee5b783.mp4?t=1741766270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indian Snacks Galore:</strong> Serve crispy samosas, prepare mouthwatering vada pav, and offer chilled Kokila Kola to satisfy a variety of cravings for hungry travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531970/extras/7e653f8862f1f1c23ea02699ba5d086e.poster.avif?t=1741766270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\