=1741766270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Mysteries Unfold:</strong> Encounter strange events and uncover the hidden, spine-chilling secrets lurking in the station\u2019s shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Indian Vibes:</strong> Immerse yourself in the cultural essence of India with vibrant visuals, detailed environments, and an atmospheric soundtrack that brings Fakripur to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s brewing chai or unraveling mysteries, <strong>Railway Chai Wala</strong> is a game that blends the warmth of Indian hospitality with the thrill of suspense. Can you thrive as Fakripur\u2019s favorite chaiwala while braving the station\u2019s enigmatic secrets? The answers await in this one-of-a-kind adventure!</p>",
